//? Title: N-Step DQN: Explicit Reward Accumulation and Bootstrap Horizons
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
The complete source CartPole protocol uses native tensors and explicit caller-owned Adam, target updates and replay. The source default is a bounded512-step demonstration; full-training convergence checks are deferred in that mode. The original opt-in full budget remains available with DATAMUNGE_EXAMPLES_FULL=1. No TensorFlow parity or solved-control claim is made from the bounded run.
)
\toc

> Architecture and learning data

4 ->128 ->128 ->2 Q; n-step target. Source hidden width128, action count2 and observation width4 are retained; detailed parameter names and distributions remain editable below.

